{"id":23056,"name":"一场谎言的终幕","rarity":5,"path":"Rogue","desc":"巡猎命途专属的光锥，光锥技能仅对该命途生效。","story":"<i>「《侦探推理入门》是怎么说的来着？非到不得已之时……」</i>\\n红与黑交织的獠牙，正一寸寸攀上肩头。\\n\\n夜色沉溺之处，疑云涌现。幽暗的森林中，恶兽藏匿。\\n<i>「你追我赶的游戏，该结束了。」</i>\\n血色褪去，天幕上月光依旧皎洁，星星安然沉睡。 \\n\\n这是他对真相的又一次寻索，但过去的影子拍拍他的肩膀，随之消散而去。\\n今时此刻的周旋，直到——\\n\\n<i>「直到…为罪恶降下惩罚的那天。」</i>","max_promotion":6,"max_rank":5,"skill":{"id":23056,"name":"吞没","desc":"使装备者的暴击率提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#1[i]%</unbreak></color>。战斗开始时或装备者每累计施放<unbreak>#2[i]</unbreak>次追加攻击，使装备者获得【影噬】，持续<unbreak>#3[i]</unbreak>回合。当装备者持有【影噬】时，攻击力提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#4[i]%</unbreak></color>，并使敌方全体受到的伤害提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#5[i]%</unbreak></color>，同类效果无法叠加。","level":{"1":{"level":1,"param_list":[0.18,4,3,0.4,0.2]},"2":{"level":2,"param_list":[0.21,4,3,0.5,0.225]},"3":{"level":3,"param_list":[0.24,4,3,0.6,0.25]},"4":{"level":4,"param_list":[0.27,4,3,0.7,0.275]},"5":{"level":5,"param_list":[0.3,4,3,0.8,0.3]}}},"stats":{"0":{"hp_base":38.4,"hp_add":5.76,"attack_base":28.8,"attack_add":4.32,"defence_base":24,"defence_add":3.6,"max_level":20,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":5000},{"ItemID":116001,"ItemNum":8}]},"1":{"hp_base":84.48,"hp_add":5.76,"attack_base":63.36,"attack_add":4.32,"defence_base":52.8,"defence_add":3.6,"max_level":30,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":10000},{"ItemID":110271,"ItemNum":4},{"ItemID":116001,"ItemNum":12}]},"2":{"hp_base":145.92,"hp_add":5.76,"attack_base":109.44,"attack_add":4.32,"defence_base":91.2,"defence_add":3.6,"max_level":40,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":20000},{"ItemID":110272,"ItemNum":4},{"ItemID":116002,"ItemNum":8}]},"3":{"hp_base":207.36,"hp_add":5.76,"attack_base":155.52,"attack_add":4.32,"defence_base":129.6,"defence_add":3.6,"max_level":50,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":50000},{"ItemID":110272,"ItemNum":8},{"ItemID":116002,"ItemNum":12}]},"4":{"hp_base":268.8,"hp_add":5.76,"attack_base":201.6,"attack_add":4.32,"defence_base":168,"defence_add":3.6,"max_level":60,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":100000},{"ItemID":110273,"ItemNum